      "excerpt_lines": [
        {
          "line": 11,
          "text": "`RUSTY_V8_ARCHIVE`/`RUSTY_V8_SRC_BINDING_PATH` with Codex release assets. Bazel"
        },
        {
          "line": 21,
          "text": "- Rust crate: `v8 = =150.4.0`"
        },
        {
          "line": 55,
          "text": "- `rusty-v8-v<crate_version>`"
        },
        {
          "line": 95,
          "text": "used by `rusty_v8 v150.4.0`, compiles published artifact targets with"
        },
        {
          "line": 109,
          "text": "Release and CI Cargo builds for Darwin and Linux use `RUSTY_V8_ARCHIVE` plus a"
        },
        {
          "line": 110,
          "text": "downloaded `RUSTY_V8_SRC_BINDING_PATH` to point at those `openai/codex` release"
        },
        {
          "line": 111,
          "text": "assets directly. We do not use `RUSTY_V8_MIRROR` because the upstream `v8` crate"
        },
        {
          "line": 113,
          "text": "under `rusty-v8-v<crate_version>`."
        },
        {
          "line": 144,
          "text": "already verified local pair supplied together as `RUSTY_V8_ARCHIVE` and"
        },
        {
          "line": 145,
          "text": "`RUSTY_V8_SRC_BINDING_PATH`. Explicit pairs and `V8_FROM_SOURCE` retain the"
        },
        {
          "line": 149,
          "text": "### Verified 150.4.0 GNU sandbox release input"
        },
        {
          "line": 152,
          "text": "[`rusty-v8-v150.4.0`](https://github.com/openai/codex/releases/tag/rusty-v8-v150.4.0)"
        },
        {
          "line": 160,
          "text": "| `librusty_v8_ptrcomp_sandbox_release_x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.a.gz` | 29,366,352 | `a35c75d1f26e6a983885a45b33490a4ebe54f05050568b32b89cfb421b30b583` |"
        },
        {
